So I have just finished the game. It turned out to be one of the best games i have ever played. The reasons are:
- The storyline is full of twists and it's presentation is a bit unusual - you find things out via SMS texting with other characters;
- The game is pleasantly forcing to twist one's mind while leaving a ton of ways to achieve one's objectives;
- Crosslink is one of the best abilities I have ever seen in any game;
- Texting with others is superfun since they tend to be hillarious;
- The soundtrack suits this game very well.
The only problem about this game is its lengh - I have managed to complete it in 2 hours. However, [LIGHT SPOILER] multiple endings and Steam workshop support leaves a lot of replayability to extend the play time. And for 1.40 euros (when on sale), this game is absolutely worth it.
10/10

